same thing happened again.

01:10:14.058 --> 01:10:16.740
Everything just died.

01:10:16.740 --> 01:10:17.760
Oh God.

01:10:17.760 --> 01:10:22.760
And a woman our age, or
like, she's in her 30s

01:10:24.085 --> 01:10:25.650
that I did not know.

01:10:25.650 --> 01:10:26.483
Oh no.

01:10:26.483 --> 01:10:29.548
Like she, you know, she
had an emotional reaction

01:10:29.548 --> 01:10:33.270
to the fact that when they
were finally getting into it.

01:10:33.270 --> 01:10:35.100
Oh gosh, I'm getting, oh, I'm.

01:10:35.100 --> 01:10:35.933
This woman.

01:10:35.933 --> 01:10:36.766
My face is getting red.

01:10:36.766 --> 01:10:40.500
This woman that I did not
know, like when the music

01:10:40.500 --> 01:10:43.617
just dies, just whips
around and looks at me

01:10:43.617 --> 01:10:46.260
and is like, dude!

01:10:46.260 --> 01:10:47.490
Gah, what?

01:10:47.490 --> 01:10:48.600
Come on.

01:10:48.600 --> 01:10:51.630
She's like, and I'm like,
it's like it's one thing

01:10:51.630 --> 01:10:54.930
for like some middle school,
but like, and you know what?

01:10:54.930 --> 01:10:55.890
I forgive her.

01:10:55.890 --> 01:10:59.940
I lured her into a trance
of enjoyment that then

01:10:59.940 --> 01:11:03.240
I snatched her out of
it, and all she could do

01:11:03.240 --> 01:11:06.240
was just emote at who?

01:11:06.240 --> 01:11:07.470
The DJ that she didn't know.

01:11:07.470 --> 01:11:08.755
For all she knew.

01:11:08.755 --> 01:11:09.759
Yeah.

01:11:09.759 --> 01:11:10.781
It was the guy that was paid

01:11:10.781 --> 01:11:12.660
to be there and wear full camo.

01:11:12.660 --> 01:11:14.110
You certainly look like it.

01:11:14.983 --> 01:11:16.860
I didn't fit in with any
of my many adults there,

01:11:16.860 --> 01:11:20.400
you know, so it's like, that hurt, man.

01:11:20.400 --> 01:11:21.729
Hold on, so what happened that time?

01:11:21.729 --> 01:11:26.729
I said I'm sorry, it's my computer.

01:11:27.783 --> 01:11:30.750
Ah, ah, you know.

01:11:30.750 --> 01:11:31.950
What happened?

01:11:31.950 --> 01:11:34.273
The USB disconnected.

01:11:34.273 --> 01:11:35.910
But how does that happen?

01:11:35.910 --> 01:11:38.910
Because I had to raise up
my laptop by putting it

01:11:38.910 --> 01:11:41.430
on top of the suitcase
that I brought my deck in

01:11:41.430 --> 01:11:43.560
and the suitcase was empty and it was

01:11:43.560 --> 01:11:48.480
a plastic shell suitcase
and it sagged in such that

01:11:48.480 --> 01:11:52.620
when the laptop sagged in, it disconnected

01:11:52.620 --> 01:11:55.620
the USB adapter to my deck.

01:11:55.620 --> 01:11:58.680
So it unplugged it and it
just slowly happens whenever,

01:11:58.680 --> 01:12:00.360
like if you bump the table or something.

01:12:00.360 --> 01:12:03.120
Doesn't like Questlove have
like a branded like, lock

01:12:03.120 --> 01:12:05.550
that you can put on your cable?

01:12:05.550 --> 01:12:08.128
Doesn't any DJ worth this
salt have like a setup

01:12:08.128 --> 01:12:10.140
where that doesn't happen?

01:12:10.140 --> 01:12:11.390
I'm buying one today.

01:12:11.390 --> 01:12:12.750
Yeah.

01:12:12.750 --> 01:12:14.632
This ain't gonna happen again.

01:12:14.632 --> 01:12:15.510
Why didn't you buy one that night?

01:12:15.510 --> 01:12:17.910
But it, dude, I'm gonna tell you,

01:12:17.910 --> 01:12:22.910
I went from the best DJ
experience that any DJ

01:12:24.480 --> 01:12:29.480
could ever have to one
of the most humiliating.

01:12:29.850 --> 01:12:33.330
Like, I mean, I might
as well have been naked.

01:12:33.330 --> 01:12:35.370
How did you recover from that one?

01:12:35.370 --> 01:12:36.570
I didn't.

01:12:36.570 --> 01:12:37.530
Party over at that point?

01:12:37.530 --> 01:12:42.530
Well, I said, I apologized
profusely and then I was like,

01:12:42.598 --> 01:12:46.380
I had also hooked up my phone
to the Bluetooth on speaker

01:12:46.380 --> 01:12:48.090
and I just started
playing music on my phone

01:12:48.090 --> 01:12:49.440
and I shut my laptop.

01:12:49.440 --> 01:12:50.340
Oh gosh.

01:12:50.340 --> 01:12:52.080
I shut my laptop and I just started

01:12:52.080 --> 01:12:53.569
playing music from my phone.

01:12:53.569 --> 01:12:54.402
Oh.

01:12:54.402 --> 01:12:58.140
And I was so disappointed.

01:12:58.140 --> 01:13:03.140
Like I was just so, I wasn't mad.

01:13:04.410 --> 01:13:09.410
I wasn't, you know, I was
just disappointed, you know.

01:13:09.660 --> 01:13:10.927
I wanted to.
What was Christy

01:13:10.927 --> 01:13:13.050
