playing stuff on my phone,

01:13:17.280 --> 01:13:19.980
they kept dancing and it was okay,

01:13:19.980 --> 01:13:21.253
and then I tried to skip to the next song.

01:13:21.253 --> 01:13:23.580
It's like, why did you skip that song?

01:13:23.580 --> 01:13:26.550
It's like they were, the
people were not letting up.

01:13:26.550 --> 01:13:27.383
Yeah, yeah.

01:13:27.383 --> 01:13:28.440
They were like.

01:13:28.440 --> 01:13:29.760
You're also in Los Angeles.

01:13:29.760 --> 01:13:33.357
Like, one of the things that
I've learned multiple times

01:13:33.357 --> 01:13:37.530
is that so many people, whether they work

01:13:37.530 --> 01:13:40.380
in the entertainment
industry or they are so close

01:13:40.380 --> 01:13:42.589
