industry, that's why most acts

01:13:42.589 --> 01:13:46.110
don't like to perform in LA,
because it's the judgiest,

01:13:46.110 --> 01:13:47.250
even if they're your friends.

01:13:47.250 --> 01:13:48.398
Yeah.

01:13:48.398 --> 01:13:49.231
It's the judgiest crowd in the world

01:13:49.231 --> 01:13:51.720
because this is like the
center of entertainment,

01:13:51.720 --> 01:13:53.854
and so the standards and the
way they look at everything,

01:13:53.854 --> 01:13:55.650
that puts you in a really tough position.

01:13:55.650 --> 01:13:57.450
I, yeah.

01:13:57.450 --> 01:14:02.450
I just, I mean I literally,
I had to shut down my system.

01:14:02.730 --> 01:14:04.860
I just, it failed.

01:14:04.860 --> 01:14:07.380
It literally failed,
and then I'm just a dude

01:14:07.380 --> 01:14:12.380
playing songs from his phone,
but that did salvage it.

01:14:13.080 --> 01:14:16.830
I mean, I literally
almost killed the party

01:14:16.830 --> 01:14:20.490
like those two times and then
there were two other times

01:14:20.490 --> 01:14:22.560
when I just bumped the
USB and it just stopped

01:14:22.560 --> 01:14:23.610
