01:14:23.610 --> 01:14:26.670
There's another way to see
this that may be encouraging.

01:14:26.670 --> 01:14:27.564
I have another way.

01:14:27.564 --> 01:14:30.870
I mean, I have some
conclusions, but go ahead.

01:14:30.870 --> 01:14:34.830
Is that you, what you got was, in this

01:14:34.830 --> 01:14:39.830
second party situation is you
were tangibly appreciating

01:14:42.579 --> 01:14:47.520
