great responsibility, man.

01:15:19.920 --> 01:15:21.300
Like, you're a DJ now.

01:15:21.300 --> 01:15:22.290
There's no looking back.

01:15:22.290 --> 01:15:23.841
There's no looking back.

01:15:23.841 --> 01:15:24.870
I mean, Elkhound cannot

01:15:24.870 --> 01:15:26.100
